摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Gives DSH one place to browse and enter its auxiliary features. It adds an extra surface to DSH that presents different content as cards. Reviewing and installing an external plugin, checking the DSH core version and updating it in one click, and more. Any external plugin can reg","id":"gh:1441500881","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-homepage","slug":"AngelosZou/dsh-homepage","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Gives DSH one place to browse and enter its auxiliary features. It adds an extra surface to DSH that"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" presents different content as cards. Reviewing and installing an external plugin, checking the DSH "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"core version and updating it in one click, and more. Any external plugin can reg"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-homepage"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-homepage` gives DSH one place to browse and enter its auxiliary features. It adds an\nextra surf"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ace to DSH that presents different content as cards, and a card expands to offer\nentry points to tho"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"se features — reviewing and installing an external plugin through a\ndelegated session, checking the "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"DSH core version and updating it in one click, seeing\nwhether sessions are running, managing local S"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"kills, and more. The cards are modular by\ndesign, so any external plugin can register its own; their"},{"id":"p4s6","text":" artwork, layout and motion can\nall be customized into a personal home page."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Installing through npm is recommended:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"You can also give a DSH session the address of this repository and ask the agent to\ncomplete the ins"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"so give a DSH session the address of this repository and ask the agent to\ncomplete the installation."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Node.js >= 22.19**\n- **DSH 0.2.x**"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Cards"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Eleven cards ship: the preview shows the readings, expanding opens the full view. Click a\ncard to fl"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"oat it over the wall, drag its title to reorder, and use **Customize** for\nartwork, visibility and m"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" over the wall, drag its title to reorder, and use **Customize** for\nartwork, visibility and motion."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Card | What it does |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **Plugin audit** | Runs a capability-limited session that statically reviews a plugin's source. Th"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e host fetches the artifact from an allowlisted platform into an immutable snapshot; the session can"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" only read that snapshot and report a verdict. Only a source pinned to an exact version/commit can b"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"e installed, and installation always waits for the user's confirmation |\n| **Sessions** | How many s"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"essions are running, waiting on you or unread, each with a shortcut into it. |\n| **Projects** | Ever"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"y workspace's branch, dirty count, ahead/behind, last commit, session count and extra worktrees. |\n|"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" **Tool usage** | Tool call counts, error rate, argument and output volume, estimated tokens and tim"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"e, filterable by project. |\n| **Token usage** | Balance and today's spend, with history, wallets, bo"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"nus credit and account links. |\n| **Network** | A quick view of the DSH core's network environment v"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"ariables. |\n| **Device** | CPU, memory, GPU/VRAM and disk. |\n| **DSH storage** | The DSH home's size"},{"id":"p14s11","text":", what is reclaimable, the largest categories and old-log cleanup. |\n| **DSH core** | The latest ver"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"sion in the DSH repository against the installed core, with a one-click update. |\n| **Workspace grou"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"ps** | Manage the sidebar groups. |\n| **Skills** | Browse and manage installed Skills, and discover "},{"id":"p14s14","text":"and install community Skills. |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Extending the cards"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Any other plugin can add cards through the interface. The full interface documentation is\nin **docs/"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"in can add cards through the interface. The full interface documentation is\nin **docs/card-api.md**."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Model-facing tool"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin provides a model-callable `homepage` tool that reads the same data as the cards.\nIt is **"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"off by default** and has to be turned on manually in the plugin's settings on the\nPlugins page. Enab"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ling the tool injects its context into a session: the tool can reach the\ninformation of every card, "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"including cards implemented by external plugins, and depending\non a card's implementation that may h"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"and the agent information it did not expect."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Storage"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The plugin stores its data under `<DSH_HOME>/storages/dsh-homepage`. `<DSH_HOME>` prefers\nthe `DSH_H"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"OME` environment variable; when that variable is absent, `~/.dsh` is used."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Issues and pull requests are welcome. The development loop, the repository layout and the\nchecks a c"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"hange has to pass are in CONTRIBUTING.md."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE. Copyright (c) 2026 Yutong Zou."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
